!name The Holdout
!players 4
!mode holdout
!notes One town, four doors. Everything worth having is outside them.
; A co-operative map: commanders start inside a walled town with a gap in each
; wall, and the waves walk in at the gates. Those four doorways are the whole
; game. Every resource node is outside the wall, so an economy is something you
; have to go out and hold rather than something you are handed.
